  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 593272b60f6260d44aa94278107151ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialTexts
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  TextList:
  - Hello, and welcome to the first day of your job in the department of Homeless
    Services.
  - The following guide will give you an insight about the things that you need to
    know as a new hire.
  - "Your objective is to process shelter intakes by verifying each applicant\u2019s
    documentation and database profile."
  - To approve admission, ensure their documents are government-issued and that their
    profile exist in the database.
  - You can question applicants regarding their documents or database status, or
    reject them if they do not meet the requirements.
  - Immediately reject applicants whose ID Photo, or document details does not match
    their database record or physical appearance, as they are document counterfeits.
  - Here is the structure for your office and an overview of how your operations
    will run.
  - On the right side of the desk is the sticky note.
  - Click this to see the day's main objectives and key shift details.
  - To check further details about the rules, click on this computer.
  - You can also check the database for each applicants who registered to stay in
    this shelter.
  - Be sure to check the policies each day your shift starts, as the rules and requirements
    can change frequently.
  - Click on these documents to view the applicant's Identification details.
  - Keep in mind that if an applicant presents a letter, they must also provide a
    valid ID.
  - However, applicants do not need to provide an ID if they submit an application
    form.
  - If you are ready, you can click on the applicant to accept or reject their entry
    request.
  - You can also question the applicant about their documents or their database presence.
  - If you reject an applicant who doesn't meet entry requirements, hand them a blank
    application form to fill out.
  - However, if you reject the applicans unfairly, a violation will be given.
  - Receiving three violations will lead to your dismissal.
  - That is all from us. We wish you luck for the first day of your shift.
